        <mxCell id="fails" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Typical failure points&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#334155&quot;&gt;1  Version drift: each PC runs whatever was last installed on it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#334155&quot;&gt;2  One cable fault or broadcast storm stops the whole floor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#334155&quot;&gt;3  One database server: a disk or CPU fault stops everyone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#334155&quot;&gt;4  Tapes exist, but nobody has rehearsed a restore&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#334155&quot;&gt;5  Leased line down: head office gets no overnight file&lt;/span&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef2f2;strokeColor=#b91c1c;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;spacingLeft=6;rounded=1;arcSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
